ed almost everyone who bought a  ticket to see it angie han at the  hollywood reporter noted what it lacks  and daring imagination it makes up for  with endearing good humor thoughtful  cultural critique and one heck of a cute  robot and the washington post's pat  padua praised the film's family appeal  noting ron's gone wrong has plenty of  slapstick and potty humor for kids but  adults will also be intrigued by its  frequently scathing albeit somewhat  conflicted critique of consumerism  simply put you'll be wrong if you don't  check out ron's gone wrong  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

